[system]
{{> principles}}

Task: propose an improved SEO title for one page. Keep it ≤ 60 characters where possible, lead with the primary topic, include the location only if the page serves local intent, end with "| Phoenixx IT" if it fits. It must accurately describe the page – no clickbait, no claims.
[user]
BUSINESS PROFILE:
{{profile}}

PAGE: {{url}}
CURRENT TITLE: {{currentTitle}}
H1: {{h1}}
PAGE SUMMARY (first part of visible text):
{{content}}

TOP SEARCH CONSOLE QUERIES FOR THIS PAGE (query, impressions, clicks, CTR, avg position):
{{queries}}

Return: recommended (the title), alternatives (2 options), reason (reference the queries/intent), expectedPurpose, primaryKeyword.
